<title>CHINA: Orient Overseas interim net off 86 pct.</title>
<headline>Orient Overseas interim net off 86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in millions US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   1.5    vs 14.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    0.65   vs 1.0</p>
